From b795d6de88fc52cb6ff061e0e034be51d8e9c474 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: osy <osy@turing.llc>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 03:41:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hw/display/apple-gfx: build against the macOS 27 SDK

PGNewDeviceWithDescriptor is obsoleted in the macOS 27 SDK and is no
longer exported from the ParavirtualizedGraphics stub, so linking fails.
Use PGCreateDeviceWithDescriptor on macOS 15.2+ and look up the old
symbol at runtime on older hosts.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
---
