or SVE access) on an address nothing is mapped at cannot be emulated,
and QEMU aborted on assert(isv), taking the VM down.  A Windows guest
gets there at shutdown: it turns off the virtio-gpu device's memory
decoding, so its BARs drop out of the address space, while an
application is still writing through its mapping of a hostmem blob.

