From a8dfd66f4ccbd9b253d21d5a4d1977950116ae80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Castell=C3=B3?= <bfcastello@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:07:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mac_dbdma, screamer: only write back res_count and
 xfer_status

The hardware only updates those two fields when a command completes.
Writing back the whole cached descriptor could undo changes the guest
made to it in the meantime.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 hw/audio/screamer.c       | 24 ++++++++++++++++++------
